tive-time density, avoiding division by the vanishing coefficient.","claim_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/support.zero_curvature"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=fixed-time-coercivity&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=fixed-time-coercivity"},{"ref":"sha256:9e0f6d255eb0a116c513a0c11e94d28559f0a429ef365c3137bb4ff3b6a061d6/papers/long.md/sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json/passages/density","stage":"long","anchor":"density","content_span":{"start_byte":152897,"end_byte":156825,"start_line":3342,"end_line":3398},"section_ref":"sha256:9e0f6d255eb0a116c513a0c11e94d28559f0a429ef365c3137bb4ff3b6a061d6/papers/long.md/sections/152825","section_title":"9. Density and finite-disorder consequences","claim_refs":["sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Derives the smooth-density part through a continuous quotient and simultaneous polynomial-moment bootstrap. Strict positivity is the separate density-positive passage; full support alone does not establish either conclusion.","claim_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=density&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=density"},{"ref":"sha256:9e0f6d255eb0a116c513a0c11e94d28559f0a429ef365c3137bb4ff3b6a061d6/papers/long.md/sha256:7588abc48d1c21bb64c366849eaa851938d6acc6b17cf16f89ccf8b87ca26853/papers/long.json/passages/density-positive","stage":"long","anchor":"density-positive","content_span":{"start_byte":156885,"end_byte":159212,"start_line":3401,"end_line":3440},"section_ref":"sha256:9e0f6d255eb0a116c513a0c11e94d28559f0a429ef365c3137bb4ff3b6a061d6/papers/long.md/sections/152825","section_title":"9. Density and finite-disorder consequences","claim_refs":["sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation","application"],"rationale":"Applies the shared fixed-time spatial estimate after smoothness and moment saturation. Its proof destination records the nonminimizing artificial plateaus and fixed-strip transfer.","claim_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=density-positive&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=long&passage=density-positive"},{"ref":"sha256:7b07c474e9e4b493474081a793473deb1d5ecae2fdcc29bf9c00dc4caa8bbe8a/papers/short.md/sha256:b3fb22a55f09aba18f53cd9bbac859142355ee389bba5aa7bf98d016dc611a43/papers/short.json/passages/density-consequence","stage":"short","anchor":"density-consequence","content_span":{"start_byte":26300,"end_byte":32194,"start_line":556,"end_line":673},"section_ref":"sha256:7b07c474e9e4b493474081a793473deb1d5ecae2fdcc29bf9c00dc4caa8bbe8a/papers/short.md/sections/26197","section_title":"4. A second use: the density cannot vanish inside the interval","claim_refs":["sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density","sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity"],"evidence_class":"source_argument","treatments":[{"claim_id":"scalar.smooth_positive_density","kinds":["derivation"],"rationale":"Develops smoothness from the quotient of moments before differentiating, then transfers the quantitative spatial-moment inequality through local constant replacements at a fixed interior time. Compact-strip stability is a cited input; positivity is asserted only for 0<t<1, and the argument does not transfer third time derivatives or add formal acceptance.","claim_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/scalar.smooth_positive_density"},{"claim_id":"support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity","kinds":["derivation","explanation"],"rationale":"Derives the continuous-coefficient fixed-time inequality by admissible local constant replacement and common-strip convergence of spatial moments, then applies it after q=t. Minimality is unnecessary for the transfer itself.","claim_ref":"sha256:c941bb8e2efcb2c545fdebbfec6f904193275455192bec48bcb452c5b8ab7f97/nodes/support.fixed_time_spatial_coercivity"}],"query_href":"/api/v1/papers/query?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=short&passage=density-consequence&representation=matches","reading_href":"/api/v1/papers/reading?manifest=79bf16ac8ab3a2adf5741ab97b2e4bd813e1c0a1940efbbdf9e35523f00de8bb&paper=short&passage=density-consequence"},{"ref":"sha256:a27286323604d97b33cbece7bb75d3d3291f7d7ec1ed0bfe12af548d92ff72dc/papers/expository.md/sha256:082c1187f897999ee934fa70dbb519221ed1e0aebc169fac91b7211a4a599dc5/papers/expository.json/passages/density-and-approximation","stage":"expository","anchor":"density-and-approximation","content_span":{"start_byte":52497,"end_byte":53236,"start_line":1248,"end_line":1257},"section_ref":"sha256:a27286323604d97b33cbece7bb75d3d3291f7d7ec1ed0bfe12af548d9